This app is a beautiful, powerful digital thermometer, you can use the mobile phone to measure room temperature, body temperature, convenient and intelligent, with a small function of illness record.
Subscribe:
1. Users can use all functions such as thermometer, hygrometer and illness record without limitation only after paying subscription;
2.subscription will be deducted from the user's iTunes account upon confirmation of purchase, free trial for three days, renewable automatically, renewal fee $39.99/year;
3. users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. the Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.
